<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN'S AMOR IN DOUBT FOR CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN'S AMOR IN DOUBT FOR CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish midfielder Guillermo Amor is in doubt for Sunday's vital World Cup qualifier against the Czech Republic after missing Thursday's training due to the 'flu.</p>
<p>Amor's Barcelona team mates Miguel Angel Nadal and Sergi Barjuan have already pulled out of the squad through injury.</p>
</text>
